    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Philadelphia Fed Survey: Business Conditions Expected to be Mixed in 2025</h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">09 Jan ’25</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia surveyed Chamber of Commerce for Greater Philadelphia members in November 2024. The survey found a third of members expected conditions will improve in 2025, while another third expected conditions will get worse.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


    </div>

</div>

